|Global Geomec parameters are stored in the registry (USER) and known between Geomec sessions.
|
|Some Global parameters are:
|
|Start Modelwizard at Geomec startup
|Path to Temporary files folder
|Unit system
|Path to Model folder
|
|
	    )
